# Maria Padilha optional application catalogue.
#
# Thunderbird is deliberately optional: the base desktop package does not
# depend on it, and the installer only adds this group when asked. Keep this
# list in sync with packaging/PKGBUILD's optdepends and install.sh's
# office-mail group. The maria-padilha-os package selection consumes the same
# group so the ISO work does not need to duplicate the app list.
#
# Fields: group<TAB>package<TAB>desktop entry<TAB>description
office-mail	thunderbird	thunderbird.desktop	Email client and mailto: handler
